7.prompt-chaining
Prompt 1 – Requirement Analysis
 Analyze the flight search requirement and identify functional requirements, user actions, and validations.

Prompt 2 – Test Scenarios
 Generate positive, negative, and boundary test scenarios based on the identified requirements.

Prompt 3 – Test Cases
 Convert the scenarios into detailed test cases with Test Case ID, Steps, Test Data, and Expected Results.

Prompt 4 – Automation
 Convert the finalized test cases into Selenium Java automation scripts using TestNG and Page Object Model (POM).

Flow: Requirement → Scenarios → Test Cases → Automation

